        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Shepherd's pie uses lamb. Cottage pie uses beef. This recipe needs time: 30 minutes for the filling to reduce and another 30 in the oven. It is worth it." }]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
